        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-WST03080, Back-to-Back 80 Inch Stainless Steel Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 80 Inch Wasatch Pull Pair is made out of stainless steel with a satin stainless steel finish. It has 61 inch mounting centers and comes packaged as a pair with everything you need to mount it back-to-back. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions 80 Inch Wasatch Back-to-Back Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 80\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 61\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "80 Inch Wasatch Pull",
                "description": "The 80 Inch Wasatch Pull Pair is made out of stainless steel with a satin stainless steel finish. It has 61 inch mounting centers and comes packaged as a pair with everything you need to mount it back-to-back.",
